	<rowsItem>
		<index>9</index>
		<row>
			<formatIndex>14</formatIndex>
			<c>
				<c>
					<f>20</f>
					<tl>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>en</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>   We, the undersigned, [PositionOfResponsiblePerson] of [RepresentationOfTheOrganization], [NameOfResponsiblePerson], on the one hand, and [JobTitleOfCounterpartyExecutive] of [CounterpartyName_], [FullNameOfCounterpartyExecutive], on the other hand, have prepared this reconciliation statement to certify that:</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>fa</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>ما امضاکنندگان زیر، [PositionOfResponsiblePerson] [RepresentationOfTheOrganization]، [NameOfResponsiblePerson]، از یک طرف، و [JobTitleOfCounterpartyExecutive] [CounterpartyName_]، [FullNameOfCounterpartyExecutive]، از طرف دیگر، این صورت تطبیق را برای تأیید موارد زیر تهیه کرده‌ایم:</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>it</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>     I sottoscritti, [PositionOfResponsiblePerson] [RepresentationOfTheOrganization] [NameOfResponsiblePerson], da una parte, e [JobTitleOfCounterpartyExecutive] [CounterpartyName_] [FullNameOfCounterpartyExecutive], dall'altra, hanno redatto questo atto di verifica, come segue:</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>pl</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>   My, niżej podpisani, [PositionOfResponsiblePerson] [RepresentationOfTheOrganization] [NameOfResponsiblePerson], z jednej strony, i [JobTitleOfCounterpartyExecutive] [CounterpartyName_] [FullNameOfCounterpartyExecutive], z drugiej strony, sporządziliśmy niniejszy protokół uzgodnienia o tym, że:</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>ru</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>   Мы, нижеподписавшиеся, [PositionOfResponsiblePerson] [RepresentationOfTheOrganization] [NameOfResponsiblePerson], с одной стороны, и [JobTitleOfCounterpartyExecutive] [CounterpartyName_] [FullNameOfCounterpartyExecutive], с другой стороны, составили настоящий акт сверки в том, что:</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>tr</v8:lang>
							<v8:content> Biz, aşağıda imzası bulanan [PositionOfResponsiblePerson] [RepresentationOfTheOrganization] [NameOfResponsiblePerson], bir taraf, ve [JobTitleOfCounterpartyExecutive][CounterpartyName_][FullNameOfCounterpartyExecutive], diğer taraf, olarak bu uzlaşma yasasını hazırlamışlardır:</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>vi</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>   Chúng tôi, người ký tên dưới đây, [PositionOfResponsiblePerson][RepresentationOfTheOrganization] [NameOfResponsiblePerson], một mặt, và [JobTitleOfCounterpartyExecutive] [CounterpartyName_] [FullNameOfCounterpartyExecutive], mặt khác đã biên soạn</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
					</tl>
				</c>
			</c>
		</row>
	</rowsItem>
	<rowsItem>
